    <briefdescription>
<para>Confidential Computing support for Intel TDX and AMD SEV/SEV-SNP. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Runtime detection of the active TEE technology (CPUID + kernel driver)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Attestation report generation via the respective Linux kernel drivers</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sealed memory: AES-256-GCM encryption bound to TEE measurements</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Software fallback for non-TEE environments (CI, developer machines)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Linux kernel interfaces used</heading>
</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Intel TDX: <computeroutput>ioctl(/dev/tdx_guest, TDX_CMD_GET_REPORT0)</computeroutput> (kernel ≥ 6.2)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AMD SEV-SNP: <computeroutput>ioctl(/dev/sev-guest, SNP_GET_REPORT)</computeroutput> (kernel ≥ 5.19)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Usage</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>cc<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_confidential_computing_1a38971f360137ae080acf86e3da9569dd" kindref="member">ConfidentialComputing::create</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>detection<sp/>=<sp/>cc-&gt;detect();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(detection.type<sp/>!=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1security_1a5839a34a29cd06daa704afb85c01824dab50339a10e1de285ac99d4c3990b8693" kindref="member">TeeType::NONE</ref>)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>report<sp/>=<sp/>cc-&gt;getAttestationReport(nonce);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>send<sp/>report<sp/>to<sp/>remote<sp/>verifier<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>sealed<sp/>=<sp/>cc-&gt;seal(sensitive_key_bytes);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>recovered<sp/>=<sp/>cc-&gt;unseal(sealed);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
